Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): explain operation tops below remaining stock

Compare regional stock to authored Top during upright 2D/3D generation and show an advisory without changing moves or post safety gates. Credit prior analytic-stock removal conservatively, retain unknown model-stock history, and pin generation, prior removal, narrow features, and visible UI notes.

Fixes #104
